title The pen outlives the pass -- the roster keeps its private card under Git for the whole choir
prompt Take one bounded Dream constellation lap, reds first, prove both sides, commit whole-index, and send twice-pulled to xy.
think Council N=3867, row 2, Fire: stop on the real red, give it the allocation, and cut at the exact depth.
think Keaton and Hush are the other named hands in this checkout's record. The tree was clean before a file moved. Five named stashes stayed untouched: four Dream packages and one Hush crash stash.
think Kumara was the next named constellation row. Its 20260829 implementation already carries both independent bind refusals, so the first cold roster was the deciding seam before a stale charter edit.
obs Machine limit: the full roster spends about 35 minutes in Caravan on this pier. Tree defect: its private mktemp directory vanished before the operation ended, and the next append failed with fresh absent.
obs The repair places a repository run's private pen under the absolute Git directory. A run outside Git keeps the system temporary directory, preserving the control surface.
obs The planted refusal deletes the whole hostile TMPDIR from inside a guard. The repaired runner still returns ok and writes ran alpha; the elder runner loses its own pen and writes neither.
obs The repaired cold pass ran 105 guards with Caravan GREEN. After xy moved again through integration, the final hot pass ran 108 guards: 102 green, six red, tree_moved=no, and both newly rostered choirs green.
